      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STRIPES (4) stretched her winning streak to four when she came from a couple of spots deeper to score by 7m at this circuit and distance last time. Was also drawn deeper when she won the Triad Final in Brisbane prior. The latest win was her first outing for more than five weeks so she should be better for it. Can deliver again. EYE WISH (5) comes here off back-to-back Wagga wins, the latest by 2.3m in a heat of this series when off the back row. She is in peak form at the right time. GO EASY ON ME (3) scored from the outside barrier when resuming here and has been runner-up from the back row in both outings since. Kept up to the mark with a trial win and is unbeaten at this circuit and distance. Player from a good draw. FAKE FRIENDS (9) found form when leading to win a heat of this series here last week. Draws out but has yet to miss a place when third-up. OSHLEY (6) was a class above last start after a close second here fresh. Draws a bit wide but should be peaking.",
